sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Py as Python BranchSession
  participant Native as NativeBranchSession
  participant Meta as Metadata Store
  participant Data as Data Store

  User->>Py: execute("UPDATE/INSERT/DELETE ...")
  Py->>Native: execute(sql, params)
  Native->>Native: parse DML with native planner
  Native->>Meta: get/cached table metadata + current segment
  Meta-->>Native: live_lo/live_hi/branch_point/table schema
  Native->>Data: find overlapping physical rows by PK/index + interval
  Data-->>Native: old physical intervals
  Native->>Data: delete overlapping physical intervals
  Native->>Data: insert left remainder if needed
  Native->>Data: insert replacement/tombstone interval
  Native->>Data: insert right remainder if needed
  Native-->>Py: affected row count
  Py-->>User: ExecuteResult
